        "title": "Quick status line constants and rate limit analytics event",
        "summary": "Adds shared constants and a response type in `common/src/constants/quick-status.ts` for a quick status line shown in the hosted workspace while a turn waits for its first output. The line is generated by a small model, capped at `QUICK_STATUS_MAX_CHARS` (120), and takes the last `QUICK_STATUS_PREVIOUS_MAX_CHARS` (1500) characters of the agent's previous reply. The analytics enum in `common/src/constants/analytics-events.ts` gains `FREEBUFF_QUICK_STATUS_RATE_LIMITED` to track rate-limiting events for this feature. No runtime logic or UI rendering code is present in this diff; the constants are in place for consumers to read.",
